  "claim_scope": "Pre-registered label-free source and geometry audit for a Route 1 multi-solvent evaluation. It establishes only that the selected MNSol-v2012 solvent panel has neutral absolute records and matching supplied geometries. It does not read experimental DeltaGsolv values into records or artifacts, fit or tune a model, run a solvent calculation, score an error, select a method, or claim that any accuracy target has been met.",
